00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,445
Notice the r on the bottom.

2
00:00:01,445 --> 00:00:04,648
The smaller the bubble, the bigger the pressure inside.

3
00:00:04,648 --> 00:00:13,151
Surface tension also falls as temperature rises, and soap or detergent lowers it, which is why hot soapy water cleans so well.

